        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion KA-C6, River Rock Contour Lever with Sandcast Bronze Oval Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis leverset is made through a process called sandcasting where bronze is poured into molds made out of sand which makes every lever unique. Because of this, the Contour Leverset has a rustic feeling that makes it a great choice for historic homes. The Sandcast Contour Lever with Oval Rose is available in antique pewter, medium bronze, and dark bronze finishes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Fusion's KA-C6 has an optional 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten Bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Fusion KA Sandcast Bronze Contour Lever With C6 Oval Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Contour Leverset with Traditional Oval Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sandcast Contour Lever with Oval Rose, Fusion KA-C6",
                "description": "Fusion KA-C6, Sandcast Contour Lever with Oval Rose - This leverset is made through a process called sandcasting where bronze is poured into molds made out of sand which makes every lever unique. Because of this, the Contour Leverset has a rustic feeling that makes it a great choice for historic homes. The Sandcast Contour Lever with Oval Rose is available in antique pewter, medium bronze, and dark bronze finishes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Fusion's KA-C6 has an optional 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n",
